    <div class="terms-notice"><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span><p><strong>Please note:</strong> SDUT Swap is a student marketplace platform, not the seller or buyer in a transaction. These terms are a general explanation of platform rules and are not a substitute for legal advice or any applicable university policy or law.</p></div>

